{#
  THE ROLE SWITCH (owner, 4 Nov 2026, from a reference drawn for it): the FOOT of the rail
  names the role you are working as — a square, its name, and a "Switch" button — and opens
  the others upward. One row each: the square, the role's name, one line of what it is; the
  current one sits on a tint with a tick. Switching starts that role's own session, so each
  other row is a POST (Account\Roles, /account/switch), never a link a prefetch could follow.

  One partial for every console that carries it (the staff console and the volunteer and
  lead workspace), so the two cannot drift into two designs of one control.

  Takes: items — account_switch() (Account\Roles::menu); here — the kind this surface is;
  csrf_token; inline — true for the rows alone, in a sheet that is already open (the phone's
  "More pages"), where a menu opening upward from a bar would be a menu inside a menu.
  Draws nothing when the account holds only itself.
#}
{% set _cur = items|filter(m => m.kind == here)|first %}
{% if items|length > 1 %}
{% if not inline|default(false) %}
<details class="rs">
  <summary class="rs__bar" aria-label="{{ _cur ? _cur.label : 'Africa GATES' }}. Switch role">
    <span class="rs__sw rs__sw--on" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="rs__cur">{{ _cur ? _cur.label : 'Africa GATES' }}</span>
    <span class="rs__btn" aria-hidden="true">Switch</span>
  </summary>
  <div class="rs__menu" role="menu" aria-label="Switch role">
{% else %}
  <div class="rs__list" role="menu" aria-label="Switch role">
{% endif %}
    {% for m in items %}
      {% if m.kind == here %}
        <span class="rs__i is-on" role="menuitem" aria-current="true">
          <span class="rs__sw rs__sw--on" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="rs__t"><span class="rs__n">{{ m.label }}</span><span class="rs__s">{{ m.sub }}</span></span>
          <span class="rs__tick" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
        </span>
      {% elseif m.live %}
        <form method="post" action="/account/switch" class="rs__f" data-cn-safe>
          <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token }}"><input type="hidden" name="kind" value="{{ m.kind }}">
          <button type="submit" class="rs__i" role="menuitem">
            <span class="rs__sw" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="rs__t"><span class="rs__n">{{ m.label }}</span><span class="rs__s">{{ m.sub }}</span></span>
          </button>
        </form>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
{% if not inline|default(false) %}
</details>
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
